{"availability":"available","full":"fabiola-serralunga/arweave-via-ario-docs","name":"arweave-via-ario-docs","description":"docs: 📜 README.md — 📊🔌 API & 🌐 web showcase acting as a fallback mechanism for ar:// URIs on Arweave. Evaluates GAR gateway performance via the AR.IO SDK as part of a redundant architecture complementing ArNS and GraphQL resolution, eliminating absolute URLs.","category":"Design","language":null,"stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-03T17:15:50Z","updated":"2026-10-05T16:17:59Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://arweave-via-ario.pages.dev","topics":["ario","arweave","arweave-gateways","arweave-storage","html-css","nodejs","vercel"],"demo":"https://arweave-via-ario.pages.dev/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:20:41.019Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:20:41.019Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:20:41.019Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:08.252Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:20:41.019Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live observability for the AR.IO Arweave Gateway Registry — tracking how many 'registered' gateways are actually online and which ones are actively serving data?","Stack: Vercel Serverless Functions · @ar.io/sdk · Cloudflare Pages · vanilla JS (no framework)","Abstract: The core of this project is an API that serves as one of several fallback mechanisms designed to eliminate reliance on absolute URLs when resolving ar:// URIs on the Arweave network. By querying the Arweave Gateway Registry (GAR) in real time via the AR.IO SDK, the API provides information not only on active gateways but also on their performance based on three criteria, ensuring content resolution across the network (provided AR.IO remains operational). In this latest release, v1.0.0, we added functionality to track how many gateways serve data, with the status check available in…"],"features":["ARWEAVE: AR.IO Gateways Monitor via @ar.io/sdk"]